relais.description:
Currently: {url}

Alarm lamp: the relays follow the app's alarm. One minute before the alarm each relay starts its "while ringing" pattern and keeps it while ringing; snoozing turns everything off; after dismissing the "after dismissing" pattern runs for five minutes. "aus" means: this relay does nothing in that phase. The "Alarm lamp" switch turns all of this on and off.

Relays of the box: {lampen}
